{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity","id":969177,"title":"What would be a Rank 9/10 entity ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-14T06:18:39-07:00","id":969177,"title":"What would be a Rank 9/10 entity ?","content":"So the highest Rank entities in CoD that we know about are Rank 8 (Hellios, Luna, any others ? ) and AFAIR imperial mysteries speculates that Gaia if she even exists would be Rank 9 ? That makes we wonder what other potential entities could be of Rank 9 and what would a Rank 10 entity possibly be like ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2636-menace","name":"Menace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"527"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T06:21:48-07:00","id":969179,"title":"","content":"Richard Thomas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T06:32:22-07:00","id":969189,"title":"","content":"So vastly powerful there would be no way of really proving its existence and its existence would mostly be in the realm of the theoretical.<br /> <br /> Remember ephemeral Ranks don't increase linearly like supernaturals. Each Rank is drastically more powerful than the last, to the point that Rank 6 entities can barely show their faces on Earth without causing massive destruction and insanity around them due to their mere presence. At least when we're talking about ephemerals. Many entities go off of Ranks, and while a Rank 10 Strix would be nasty it's not on the level of a Rank 10 angel.<br /> <br /> Even if one did encounter it it probably wouldn't be recognizable as an entity. The theories would likely point that way, and do, like with Ain Soph and the Adversary. One of the books has suggested, for instance, Gaea is not just the spirit of the Earth, but the entire Shadow of Earth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 09-14-2016, 09:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T06:38:13-07:00","id":969191,"title":"","content":"Yeah I know. I'm just interested on peoples thoughts on the matter and what such entities would represent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2636-menace","name":"Menace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"527"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T06:57:29-07:00","id":969199,"title":"","content":"They don't always have to represent something. Spirits do but not everything's going to be a spirit.<br /> <br /> Father Wolf, for instance, was a Rank 10 Pangaean. It was said he <i>was </i>Pangaea, and when he was killed it was destroyed and now there's no more Pangaeans, which does sort of back that up. Pangaeans were the foundation of things, not the reflection, which people seem to confuse.<br /> <br /> He was also very scary. And some of us are stuck calling it a he because of first edition but it wasn't 'male' or 'female,' we just have a tendency to label things to make them more understandable.<br /> <br /> I'd suggest something like a Rank 10 entity would be a place, and possibly one that was unable to communicate with those inside it unless it wanted to outright destroy them. It wouldn't be concerned with the actions of humans or likely even entities Ranks 1 through 9 unless for some reason they set their mind to destroying it when it would respond in the reflexive way your skin crawls or goosebumps rise when you feel something strange touching you..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 09-14-2016, 10:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T07:08:59-07:00","id":969202,"title":"","content":"Might used the wrong words, I meant that those entities are something beyond being &quot;all powerfull and incomprehensible&quot;. Like what you said about Father Wolf is interesting.<br /> <br /> Hmm if that was the case than maybe different realms have a being that &quot;IS&quot; them ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2636-menace","name":"Menace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"527"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T07:18:30-07:00","id":969210,"title":"","content":"The Watchtowers (from Mage) might be a single Rank 10 Entity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4854-justin-sane","name":"Justin Sane","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T07:20:04-07:00","id":969212,"title":"","content":"I'd say the Supernal is one. It's not something you're going to meet walking down the street, have a chat with. But in its nature of defining itself, it has lesser reflections in the form of the Aeons, I think. I forget what they're called but they're related to the Arcana. At least one appeared in DaveB's's game, Mordred I think it went by.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T07:38:12-07:00","id":969217,"title":"","content":"Rank 9 I can see being something like the spirit of the entire sol system, 10 being the milky way.<br /> <br /> The aeons are rank 9 if I remember right. A lot of other very powerful concepts over in the astral would be as well, like the most powerful anima mundi goetia for things like fire or air.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T07:45:41-07:00","id":969222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fumus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity?p=969217#post969217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The aeons are rank 9 if I remember right.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Aeons are Rank 8.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T08:30:27-07:00","id":969239,"title":"","content":"In Tome of the Watchtowers it said that the Primal Wild is a rank 10 entity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T09:23:33-07:00","id":969268,"title":"","content":"If Gaea is Rank 9 entity ( and she probably is <i>whole Earth's Shadow Realm itself</i>! ), then Rank 10 entities are like Spirits of Galaxies. Then Ain Soph ( i.e. Monotheism God ) being would like Rank 11. ( And here we come to <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/UpToEleven?from=Main.TurnedUpToEleven\" target=\"_blank\">Up to 11</a> trope <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> What's interesting is that Solar System Spirits - if it not simply collection of Gaea, Luna, Helios, Mars, Venus and rest of Planets Spirits - would Rank<b><i> 9</i></b> Spirit, as Gaea is higher in Celestial Hierarchy, still. It's probably because Gaea is Spirit of <i>Living and Breathing World</i>, and that means she has billions of worshipers - i.e. literal all life on Earth. Other Celestial Spirits in Solar System do not have those.<br /> <br /> Intriguing would be seeing examples of Rank 9 and Rank 10 ghosts and goetia. Still, Rank 9 Goetia could be Astral Realms themselves, possibly?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T09:39:38-07:00","id":969278,"title":"","content":"Gaea was theorized at Rank 9 or 10, with the caveat that, 'It remains a debate, even among the wisest Ithaeur, exactly what Rank some of these entities are supposed to be, and who outranks whom. This is almost certainly exactly the way the spirits like it.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T10:17:45-07:00","id":969300,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity?p=969189#post969189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So vastly powerful there would be no way of really proving its existence and its existence would mostly be in the realm of the theoretical.<br /> <br /> Remember ephemeral Ranks don't increase linearly like supernaturals. Each Rank is drastically more powerful than the last, to the point that Rank 6 entities can barely show their faces on Earth without causing massive destruction and insanity around them due to their mere presence. At least when we're talking about ephemerals. Many entities go off of Ranks, and while a Rank 10 Strix would be nasty it's not on the level of a Rank 10 angel.</div> </div> </div> </div>Strix don't use Rank. They use Shadow Potency, which is more in line with the player character Supernatural Advantage than Rank is. (A Rank 4 spirit is <i>way</i> more powerful than a Blood Potency 4 Vampire or a Primal Urge 4 Werewolf. Rank 6 spirits and Goetia are statless gods, while Gnosis 6 mages are entirely playable.)<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T10:28:15-07:00","id":969304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity?p=969300#post969300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Strix don't use Rank. They use Shadow Potency, which is more in line with the player character Supernatural Advantage than Rank is. (A Rank 4 spirit is <i>way</i> more powerful than a Blood Potency 4 Vampire or a Primal Urge 4 Werewolf. Rank 6 spirits and Goetia are statless gods, while Gnosis 6 mages are entirely playable.)<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Could you give me examples of any rank 6 goetia?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T10:28:48-07:00","id":969305,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity?p=969300#post969300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Strix don't use Rank. They use Shadow Potency, which is more in line with the player character Supernatural Advantage than Rank is. (A Rank 4 spirit is <i>way</i> more powerful than a Blood Potency 4 Vampire or a Primal Urge 4 Werewolf. Rank 6 spirits and Goetia are statless gods, while Gnosis 6 mages are entirely playable.)</div> </div> </div> </div>That's right I always forget that about strix. Need to start using them.<br /> <br /> So spirits, ghosts, angels, Goetia, Supernal entities and presumably Abyssal entities so far? Pandorans seem to work off of Rank but it only goes to 5.<br /> <br /> Remembered idigam and Pangaeans, though the latter seem extinct.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T10:59:20-07:00","id":969323,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity?p=969304#post969304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Could you give me examples of any rank 6 goetia?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd imagine that any of the numerous Astral representations of the Abrahamic or Hindu Gods would be up there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T11:50:45-07:00","id":969350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity?p=969304#post969304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Could you give me examples of any rank 6 goetia?</div> </div> </div> </div>The human idea of Death is Rank 7. It rules over a collection of associated Temenos Realms that occasionally have Irises to the Underworld, and each associated Temenos Realm is the human idea of some afterlife of other. Anubis is a Rank 5 Goetic that lives in a section of Death's realm that corresponds to Kemetic ideas of Duat (but, obviously, not Iremite ones. Finding the Iremite version of Duat in the Temenos would be a pretty cool Mummy crossover point).<br /> <br /> All of the Aeons are Rank 8, they're the theoretical upper limit of what a discrete being (at least when it comes to Goetics) can be. That being said, because they are still discrete manifestations of universal concepts, they still have individuality and personality. The Aeon of Fate, who was once Sutekh, became Medraut as a result of Merlin's Ascension (if memory serves me correctly), but the Astral Realms are highly personal places, and everything is tainted and filtered by your own perception. As I understand it, with the Astral Realms you go farther in until by going further in you come out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T12:23:51-07:00","id":969374,"title":"","content":"<i>There is a yawning maw at the heart of the galaxy, a chunk of all-consuming oblivion, with a gravitic pull strong to ensnare all the Milky Way. A hundred billion stars revolve around it in an inescapable, mad dance. One day, it will consume everything, 'til only a single massive pit in space/time remains.<br /> <br /> Earth is small. Earth is meaningless. The Exarchs are a blink of the eye---less than that! Humans think themselves so important, but the consuming maw at the heart of all things is barely cognizant humanity even exists.<br /> <br /> Others came before. Others will arrive after Man is gone. In the end, only hunger matters...</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T12:30:19-07:00","id":969382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demigod Beast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity?p=969374#post969374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>There is a yawning maw at the heart of the galaxy, a chunk of all-consuming oblivion, with a gravitic pull strong to ensnare all the Milky Way. A hundred billion stars revolve around it in an inescapable, mad dance. One day, it will consume everything, 'til only a single massive pit in space/time remains.<br /> <br /> Earth is small. Earth is meaningless. The Exarchs are a blink of the eye---less than that! Humans think themselves so important, but the consuming maw at the heart of all things is barely cognizant humanity even exists.<br /> <br /> Others came before. Others will arrive after Man is gone. In the end, only hunger matters...</i></div> </div> </div> </div><i>For now. But in the distant aeons of the future, even the stars and their hungry ghosts may heed humanity's will.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T12:37:51-07:00","id":969386,"title":"","content":"... and this is how we asserted that Azathoth is Rank 10 Spirit of Milky Way. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-14-2016, 03:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T12:38:15-07:00","id":969387,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity?p=969382#post969382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <i>For now. But in the distant aeons of the future, even the stars and their hungry ghosts may heed humanity's will.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>HA! Awesome! Yeah, my take on it is a Rank 10 spirit is basically so vast the entire universe shakes as it passes by. Tiny ants like the Exarchs come and go...but <i>these</i> spirits are the only things that <i>truly</i> endure...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T12:40:39-07:00","id":969389,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity?p=969386#post969386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... and this is how we asserted that Azatoth is Rank 10 Spirit of Milky Way. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Basically, yes. However, most galaxies <i>do</i> have so-called 'supermassive black holes' in their centers. In the Shadow Realms, the spirits of these things would be beyond apocalyptic!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T13:37:08-07:00","id":969428,"title":"","content":"Personally I like to keep a geocentric take on metaphysics in CoD so no Spirits of galaxies for me :P<br /> <br /> Ideas of what Rank are the Annunnaki (abysall gods/realities). For instance the prince of 10 000 leaves ? I'd say rank 7 or 8 when not &quot;manifested&quot; but would be rank 9 when fully incarnated in the world ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2636-menace","name":"Menace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"527"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T20:56:34-07:00","id":969640,"title":"","content":"I would posit that the defining trait of rank 9 &amp; 10 Spirits is that not only are they so vast, powerful and alien that humanity cannot truly understand them, but they cannot understand us either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T22:08:55-07:00","id":969664,"title":"","content":"The God-Machine Archangels, whose purpose is to be the fundamental forces of reality, to be electromagnetism, gravity, the strong and the weak forces.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T00:06:24-07:00","id":969714,"title":"","content":"In my mind, a rank ten entity would be concepts and forces that humanity truly has difficulty comprehending or imagining. Sure, a very basic way of trying to explain infinity is to say it's an ever ascending stream of numbers, but trying to imagine the truly endless is impossible. However, I could easily imagine something that conceptually embodies this to be the equivalent of rank ten due to its own infinite nature.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-25T09:40:28-08:00","id":1008147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/969177-what-would-be-a-rank-9-10-entity?p=969386#post969386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... and this is how we asserted that Azathoth is Rank 10 Spirit of Milky Way. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If you look at the Culture wiki you have something called Cosmic Centres which are black holes that birth and destroy whole universes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1762-rogerd","name":"RogerD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1762_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-25T17:49:34-08:00","id":1008341,"title":"","content":"I keep seeing people referring to Galaxy spirits as Rank 10. That's a severe disservice to Rank 10 entities.<br /> <br /> When you're Rank 10 is the point at which other, lesser beings (anything Rank 9 or below, for example) are basically motes of Essence to you. A quark is to an atom as humans are to Rank 8+. A quark is to <i>people</i> as humans are to Rank 9+. And a quark is to the <i>entire observable universe</i>, as a human is to a Rank 10 being.<br /> <br /> To say that anything is &quot;nothing&quot; to a Rank 10 entity is being extremely charitable to that thing. In the eyes of a Rank 10 being, even fundamental, world-shaking concepts are nothing. A Rank-10 being is so far beyond any actual thing we could experience that we couldn't conceive of it. Supernal Truths and Pangeans would be like a crude stick figure compared to what they perceive. The pillars of reality and creation would have no bearing on it, as it stands above reality, reorganizing it arbitrarily. The Q Continuum would worship a Rank-10 being.<br /> <br /> In short, it's Dave Brookshaw.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}